<title>FRANCE: RALLYING-DAKAR RALLY, FIRST STAGE PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-DAKAR RALLY, FIRST STAGE PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings after the 587-km</p>
<p>first stage of the Dakar-Agades-Dakar rally on Saturday:</p>
<p>Cars:</p>
<p>1. Jean-Pierre Fontenay (France) Mitsubishi  three hours 17</p>
<p>minutes 56 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Bruno Saby (France) Mitsubishi		 2:25 behind</p>
<p> 3. Kenjiro Shinozuka (Japan) Mitsubishi	 3:21</p>
<p> 4. Jean-Louis Schlesser (France) Buggy	  5:13</p>
<p> 5. Salvador Servia (Spain) Nissan		 7:55</p>
<p> 6. Hiroshi Masuoka (Japan) Mitsubishi	  10:32</p>
<p> 7. Thierry de Lavergne (France) Nissan	 10.36</p>
<p> 8. Jean-Pierre Strugo (France) Mitsubishi    13:02</p>
<p> 9. Jose Servia I Costa (Spain) Nissan	  13:34</p>
<p> 10. Philippe Wambergue (France)		  15:53</p>
<p>Motorcycles:</p>
<p>1. Stephane Peterhansel (France) Yamaha three hours 15 minutes</p>
